<title>JAPAN: Japan key three-month CD rate hits 2-month high.</title>
<headline>Japan key three-month CD rate hits 2-month high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's key three-month certificate of deposit (CD) rate hit a two-month high of 0.60 percent on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>Around 200 billion yen of the CDs were issued at this rate, the highest amount since March 25, they added.</p>
</text>
